msgctxt "288"
msgid "Don't Order Anything"
msgstr "Non ordinare nulla"

msgctxt "309"
msgid "Check Out"
msgstr "Conto"

msgctxt "319"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Ordina"

msgctxt "325"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)"
msgstr "(Sono a corto di soldi.)  "

msgctxt "346"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altri oggetti.)"

msgctxt "378"
msgid "(I can't handle any more turtles.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altre tartarughe.)"

msgctxt "413"
msgid "(I didn't choose anything.)"
msgstr "(Non ho scelto niente.)"

msgctxt "441"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr "(Sono esauriti.)"

msgctxt "461"
msgid "Let's see. That comes to %s."
msgstr "Vediamo un po'. Il totale è %s."

msgctxt "490"
msgid ""
"Vanilla. The gold standard of ice cream, and with \n"
"good reason. Easily our most popular flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "586"
msgid ""
"Chocolate ice cream made with natural, bittersweet \n"
"cocoa. Loved by chocoholics the world over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "682"
msgid ""
"This popular mango flavor lightly tinged with vanilla\n"
"offers a truly tropical delight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "769"
msgid ""
"The Okinawan-grown bitter melon in this ice cream\n"
"gives it a consistency more akin to yogurt."
msgstr ""
"Il goya coltivato a Okinawa presente in questo gelato gli conferisce una "
"consistenza più simile allo yogurt."

msgctxt "863"
msgid ""
"Someone had the bright idea of putting green tea in\n"
"ice cream. Truly a match(a) made in heaven."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "959"
msgid ""
"Flavored with Okinawan sugar cane, which is used to\n"
"make brown sugar. Surprisingly healthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1051"
msgid ""
"This sweet potato ice cream is made from real \n"
"Okinawan sweet potatoes. Its smooth, rich flavor\n"
"makes it especially popular."
msgstr ""
"Questo gelato alla patata dolce è preparato con vere patate dolci di "
"Okinawa. Il suo sapore ricco e morbido lo rende particolarmente popolare."

msgctxt "1176"
msgid ""
"Roasted sweet yams made into ice cream. Like \n"
"nothing you've ever tasted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1250"
msgid ""
"Banapaco ice cream has banana, pineapple, and \n"
"coconut flavors all rolled into one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1334"
msgid ""
"This pineapple ice cream contains real pineapple \n"
"pulp and juice for a rich, tropical flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1428"
msgid ""
"A delicious tropical vegetable known for its shiny, \n"
"purple color."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1495"
msgid ""
"Refreshing pineapple ice cream swirled with blue \n"
"soda sherbert. As soothing as a nap on the beach."
msgstr ""
